{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/a1-explainer-about-mob-psycho-100-manga-and-anime-explaining-simply-what-it-is-about-keep/audio/main-d7014a0ac475.mp3","durationSec":114.12,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":4.4,"text":"Mob Psycho 100 first appeared as a manga, or a Japanese comic series."},{"start":4.96,"end":7.58,"text":"ONE, a Japanese artist, wrote and drew it."},{"start":8.04,"end":10.92,"text":"The series began in 2012 and ended in 2017."},{"start":11.78,"end":13.54,"text":"ONE also made One-Punch Man."},{"start":14.58,"end":18.54,"text":"Later, Mob Psycho 100 became an anime, or an animated series."},{"start":19.34,"end":22.24,"text":"People could read the story on a page or watch it move on a screen."},{"start":22.98,"end":25.32,"text":"The main person is Shigeo Kageyama."},{"start":25.86,"end":26.82,"text":"People call him Mob."},{"start":26.82,"end":30.24,"text":"He is a quiet boy, but he has psychic powers."},{"start":30.24,"end":32.82,"text":"Psychic powers are unusual powers of the mind."},{"start":32.82,"end":35.12,"text":"Mob does not mainly want to be special."},{"start":35.5,"end":36.58,"text":"He wants a normal life."},{"start":36.82,"end":41.08,"text":"This difference is important: his powers are very big, but his wish is very ordinary."},{"start":41.9,"end":43.54,"text":"Mob works with Reigen Arataka."},{"start":44.38,"end":49.54,"text":"We can understand the story with three ideas: person, wish, and problem."},{"start":50.14,"end":51.12,"text":"The person is Mob."},{"start":51.7,"end":53.44,"text":"His wish is a normal life."},{"start":53.44,"end":56.96,"text":"The problem is that his psychic powers make his life unusual."},{"start":58.14,"end":59.76,"text":"Reigen is part of Mob's work."},{"start":61.06,"end":64.62,"text":"This pattern helps us understand the basic story without knowing every event."},{"start":64.62,"end":68.72,"text":"Bones, a Japanese animation studio, later made the anime."},{"start":69.6,"end":71.92,"text":"Its first season aired in 2016."},{"start":72.78,"end":74.7,"text":"A season is one group of TV episodes."},{"start":75.46,"end":78.42,"text":"More seasons followed in 2019 and 2022."},{"start":79.54,"end":85.78,"text":"These dates show the order clearly: ONE's comic story came first, and the animated version came later."},{"start":86.48,"end":90,"text":"The story moved from drawn pages to moving pictures and sound."},{"start":91.06,"end":92.36,"text":"Now put the main facts together."},{"start":93.26,"end":96.52,"text":"ONE created the page version and wrote and drew Mob's story."},{"start":96.52,"end":98.72,"text":"Bones made the screen version later."},{"start":99.54,"end":104.28,"text":"In both forms, Shigeo “Mob” Kageyama is the quiet boy at the center."},{"start":104.84,"end":109.3,"text":"He has psychic powers, works with Reigen Arataka, and wants a normal life."},{"start":109.3,"end":113.62,"text":"Great power and an ordinary wish are the easiest way to explain the story."}],"words":[{"text":"Mob","start":0,"end":0.34},{"text":"Psycho","start":0.34,"end":0.62},{"text":"100","start":0.62,"end":1.24},{"text":"first","start":1.24,"end":1.52},{"text":"appeared","start":1.52,"end":1.86},{"text":"as","start":1.86,"end":2.08},{"text":"a","start":2.08,"end":2.22},{"text":"manga","start":2.22,"end":2.4},{"text":"or","start":3.02,"end":3.08},{"text":"a","start":3.08,"end":3.24},{"text":"Japanese","start":3.24,"end":3.56},{"text":"comic","start":3.56,"end":3.9},{"text":"series","start":3.9,"end":4.4},{"text":"ONE","start":4.96,"end":5.24},{"text":"a","start":5.68,"end":5.78},{"text":"Japanese","start":5.78,"end":6.12},{"text":"artist","start":6.12,"end":6.54},{"text":"wrote","start":6.66,"end":6.9},{"text":"and","start":6.9,"end":7.16},{"text":"drew","start":7.16,"end":7.38},{"text":"it","start":7.38,"end":7.58},{"text":"The","start":8.04,"end":8.18},{"text":"series","start":8.18,"end":8.48},{"text":"began","start":8.48,"end":8.84},{"text":"in","sta